+#pragma mark -
+#pragma mark GPU profiler (MVK_CONFIG_GPU_PROFILE=1)
+
+// Times every Metal encoder with stage-boundary GPU timestamps (Apple GPUs) and logs, every 5 s, the GPU time per
+// render pass (keyed by attachments and size) and per compute encoder (keyed by the first compute shader's code hash,
+// matching MVK_CONFIG_SHADER_DUMP_DIR file names). Diagnostic only; adds a little overhead.
